<title>USA: Thornburg Mortgage CEO buys 6,473 shares.</title>
<headline>Thornburg Mortgage CEO buys 6,473 shares.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA FE, N.M. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thornburg Mortgage Asset Corp said Friday that Garrett Thornburg, Jr., its chairman and chief executive officer, bought 6,473 shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the buy was made at a price of $19.357 per share through his participation in the company's dividend reinvestment and stock purchase plan on Thursday.</p>
<p>The stock was down 3/4 at 18-3/8 in late afternoon trading Friday.</p>
